    "winding_parameters": "Symmetric 1 mH windings, k=.02, DCR 30 ohm, Q=80, positive dot convention are engineering assumptions. Parallel capacitances derive from 455 kHz resonance, not factory values. Equivalent shunt loss subtracts winding DCR at resonance.",
    "converter_boundary": "A modulated current sink at first IF primary plate is an external test input, not a 7A8 converter model. 30 kohm plate and 120 kohm screen substitutes remain explicit.",
    "initialization": "Hot DC equilibrium with no injected signal, then carrier-resolved transient. No cold-heater or AC startup claim.",
    "inherited": "7C6/50L6 sparse curves, diode law and transformer/speaker approximations remain as declared in v0.55/v0.56.",
    "trimmer_fixture": "This increment scales both tuning capacitances of a selected IF transformer together. Independent adjustment of all four service trimmers and loaded passband alignment remain pending. The 455 kHz LC derivation is an unloaded reference, not a calibrated loaded response."
